      "message": "[Gerrit AI Review] **Minor Suggestion (Code Simplicity \u0026 Consistency):** There is duplicated timer cancellation logic across `hang_detect_cancel`, `hang_detect_reload`, `EC_HANG_DETECT_CMD_CLEAR_STATUS`, and `hang_detect_deferred_stop`. Additionally, `hang_detect_deferred_stop` cancels `hang_detect_power_on_data` but omits `hang_detect_cold_reboot_data`, which is asymmetrical.\n\nConsider extracting a helper to unify timer cancellation and ensure all stage 1 and stage 2 timers are consistently cleared:\n\n```c\nstatic void cancel_all_hang_detect_timers(void)\n{\n\thook_call_deferred(\u0026hang_detect_reboot_data, -1);\n\thook_call_deferred(\u0026hang_detect_cold_reboot_data, -1);\n\thook_call_deferred(\u0026hang_detect_power_on_data, -1);\n}\n```\n\nThen use this helper in `hang_detect_cancel`, `hang_detect_reload`, `hang_detect_deferred_stop`, and the `EC_HANG_DETECT_CMD_CLEAR_STATUS` case.\n\n[🔗](http://go/tj/532ca5fc-492d-4933-8991-a36ec4d56ae9)",
